data: {"type":"message_update","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Kgk3vDstwEggxtwqQEuxW7","name":"probe","arguments":{"question":"What is $\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin^3(2x)$? (Recall $\\sin^3(2x)$ means $\\left(\\sin(2x)\\right)^3$.)","options":[{"label":"$6\\sin^2(2x)\\cos(2x)$","value":"a"},{"label":"$3\\sin^2(2x)\\cos(2x)$","value":"b"},{"label":"$6\\cos^2(2x)$","value":"c"},{"label":"$3\\sin^2(2x)\\cdot 2$","value":"d"}],"explanation":"There are three layers: cube, then sine, then $2x$.\n$$\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\sin(2x)\\right)^3 = \\underbrace{3\\sin^2(2x)}_{\\text{cube}}\\cdot\\underbrace{\\cos(2x)}_{\\text{sine}}\\cdot\\underbrace{2}_{2x} = 6\\sin^2(2x)\\cos(2x)$$\nEach layer's derivative is evaluated at whatever sits inside it, and all three get multiplied. Dropping the $2$ or dropping the $\\cos(2x)$ means one layer was skipped."},"partialJson":"{\"question\": \"What is $\\\\frac{d}{dx}\\\\sin^3(2x)$? (Recall $\\\\sin^3(2x)$ means $\\\\left(\\\\sin(2x)\\\\right)^3$.)\", \"options\": [{\"label\":\"$6\\\\sin^2(2x)\\\\cos(2x)$\",\"value\":\"a\"},{\"label\":\"$3\\\\sin^2(2x)\\\\cos(2x)$\",\"value\":\"b\"},{\"label\":\"$6\\\\cos^2(2x)$\",\"value\":\"c\"},{\"label\":\"$3\\\\sin^2(2x)\\\\cdot 2$\",\"value\":\"d\"}], \"explanation\": \"There are three layers: cube, then sine, then $2x$.\\n$$\\\\frac{d}{dx}\\\\left(\\\\sin(2x)\\\\right)^3 = \\\\underbrace{3\\\\sin^2(2x)}_{\\\\text{cube}}\\\\cdot\\\\underbrace{\\\\cos(2x)}_{\\\\text{sine}}\\\\cdot\\\\underbrace{2}_{2x} = 6\\\\sin^2(2x)\\\\cos(2x)$$\\nEach layer's derivative is evaluated at whatever sits inside it, and all three get multiplied. Dropping the $2$ or dropping the $\\\\cos(2x)$ means one layer was skipped."}],"api":"claude-code-cli","provider":"claude-code","model":"claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":4,"cacheRead":9460,"cacheWrite":1609,"totalTokens":11075,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":1609},"stopReason":"pending","timestamp":1792860654670,"responseId":"msg_011CgMQaNM9k6cndDeYNLuYM"}}

